 null, 'Adrenaline, secreted by the adrenal medulla, prepares the body for rapid action during acute stress, mediating the "fight or flight" response.'),
('NEET PG', 'Pre- and Para-Clinical Sciences', 'Physiology', 'easy', 'mcq',
