 null, 'Under aerobic conditions, glycolysis produces pyruvate, which is then converted to acetyl-CoA and enters the citric acid cycle.'),
('NEET PG', 'Pre- and Para-Clinical Sciences', 'Biochemistry', 'easy', 'mcq',
