 null, 'Vitamin K is required for the gamma-carboxylation of clotting factors II, VII, IX, and X, essential for normal blood coagulation.'),
('NEET PG', 'Pre- and Para-Clinical Sciences', 'Biochemistry', 'medium', 'mcq',
