 'Herd immunity protects unvaccinated individuals in a population primarily by:',
 '[{"text":"Directly boosting their individual immune system","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Reducing the overall circulation of the pathogen in the population","isCorrect":true},{"text":"Making the pathogen less virulent","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Eliminating the need for any vaccination","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb,
 null, 'When a sufficiently high proportion of a population is immune, disease transmission is reduced, indirectly protecting unvaccinated or non-immune individuals.'),
